# qml/qmldir
#
# Module directory file. Registers the Bo design-system singleton so any
# QML file in this directory can `import "."` and reference Bo.* tokens.
#
# All the other components (VolumeDial, ProductSilhouette, etc.) are
# auto-discovered by filename since they live in the same directory as
# the loaded entry file — they don't need explicit lines here, but the
# singleton MUST be declared to be usable as a singleton.

singleton Bo 1.0 Bo.qml
